  "details": "This is my best setting for performance in vrchat.\n\nLof of test to get max performance and more.\n\nFor better ping and download turn off all chrome tap, game launcher etc\n\n( tested on old laptop ).\n\nNew tap \"Performance\" and all setting from my screen \n\nfor player to setup faster to get max performance \n\nchange steam minimum and recomended required to my, information\n\nlike best setting for quest, steam index resolution scale to 0.7 \n\nminimum spec for vrchat \n\nRYZEN 3600 / Intel i5‑10400F\n\nRTX 3060 12gb / Radeon RX 6700 XT 12gb\n\n32gb ram \n\nssd 50GB\n\nRead speed: 3000 MB/s\n\nWrite speed: 3000 MB/s\n\nrecomended spec for vrchat \n\nRYZEN 7600 / Intel i5‑12400F\n\nRTX 4070 12gb / Radeon RX 7700 XT 12gb\n\n64gb ram \n\nfast m2 ssd 50GB\n\nRead speed: 6000 MB/s\n\nWrite speed: 6000 MB/s",
